Ported from the TypeScript build's __tests__/cases/typescript/012-rust-doc-comments-not-header.case.yaml; expected output is the TypeScript build's, except:
- The `//!` comment is the header comment, and the `///` comment is a leading annotation of the struct, so its line range starts there; the TypeScript build skipped both.
